"""Standalone YouTube video chunk downloader.

All channel lists are embedded (compressed). Cookies are plain text below for easy editing.
Sequential downloads, no concurrency. Resumable via per-category manifest.csv.

Usage:
    uv run youtube_standalone_downloader.py
    uv run youtube_standalone_downloader.py --download-delay 20 --total-limit 100
    uv run youtube_standalone_downloader.py --category C05_nature_landscape --dry-run
"""

